- L2 diff approvals on all PRs
- L3 wave adversarial: codex-challenge + architect-reviewer + **full Suite S re-run** (DOS-287 cross-entity bleed reproduction blocked; no PII in fixtures; secrets handling end-to-end; compliance-auditor pass) + **full Suite P re-run** (burst signal storms, coalescing bounds, release-gate latency budget) + **Suite E final** (bundles 1+5 mandatory pass; bundles 2-4, 6-8 reports filed as v1.4.1 follow-ups if failing)
- **L4 surface QA:** full `/qa` against the pilot surfaces with seeded workspace; accessibility-tester pass; manual real-dev dogfood evidence captured
- `pnpm release-gate` (or `cargo run --bin release-gate`) exits zero against bundles 1+5 on the seeded workspace
- Proof bundle written
- Tag `v1.4.0` on `trunk` after `dev` merge

